                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chargé in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Munro</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-09-28T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 28,
                                1927—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>149. Your 254, September 27, 10 a.m. Solution outlined by you is satisfactory to
                    the Department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Carr</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
